# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，工作区检出也是 LF。
# 现状：所有文本文件在索引与工作区都已是 LF，本文件不会触发大规模重写。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做行尾/文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.hap binary
*.hsp binary
*.har binary
*.app binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary

# 签名与密钥材料（同时被 .gitignore 拦截，这里是双保险）
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.p7b binary
*.cer binary
*.pem binary
*.key binary
